"Beta / unstable: First Run takes 1-2 minutes because the picker enumerates every installed app and builds a tile per app. Re-Runs are fast. Touch routing into hosted windows isn't wired yet, so scrolling/typing inside a floating window may not work." = "Beta / 不稳定：首次运行需要 1-2 分钟，因为选择器会枚举所有已安装 App 并为每个 App 构建图块。再次运行会很快。托管窗口内的触摸路由尚未接好，因此悬浮窗口内的滚动/输入可能无法工作。";
