"Beta CoreLocation simulation. Requires Apple Maps installed and set up — Maps is the RemoteCall host process that drives the simulation.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nThis is a manual tool, not an installable package. Use Simulate Current Target to start; use Restore Real Location to stop simulation and return CoreLocation to the device's real providers. Each run opens the activity log and marks completion when the request returns.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nNot all apps respect the simulated location. Apps that use their own location validation or additional signals may ignore it.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCredits: kolbicz for the RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer prototype, and ezzuldinSt's LSpoof for picker/route references.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nWarning: this can affect more than maps. Location-tied system behavior, including time zone and date/time handling, may behave unexpectedly. Only use this if you know what you're doing." = "Beta CoreLocation 模拟。需要已安装并设置 Apple Maps；Maps 是驱动模拟的 RemoteCall 宿主进程。\\n\\n这是手动工具，不是可安装包。使用 Simulate Current Target 开始；使用 Restore Real Location 停止模拟并让 CoreLocation 回到真实定位提供者。每次运行都会打开活动日志，并在请求返回后标记完成。\\n\\n并非所有 App 都会接受模拟位置。使用自身定位校验或额外信号的 App 可能会忽略它。\\n\\n鸣谢：kolbicz 的 RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer 原型，以及 ezzuldinSt 的 LSpoof 选择器/路线参考。\\n\\n警告：此功能影响的不只是地图。与位置相关的系统行为，包括时区和日期/时间处理，可能出现异常。仅在你知道自己在做什么时使用。";
"Beta CoreLocation simulation. Requires Apple Maps installed and set up — Maps is the RemoteCall host process that drives the simulation.\\\\n\\\\nThis is a manual tool, not an installable package. Use Simulate Current Target to start; use Restore Real Location to stop simulation and return CoreLocation to the device's real providers. Each run opens the activity log and marks completion when the request returns.\\\\n\\\\nNot all apps respect the simulated location. Apps that use their own location validation or additional signals may ignore it.\\\\n\\\\nCredits: kolbicz for the RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer prototype, and ezzuldinSt's LSpoof for picker/route references.\\\\n\\\\nWarning: this can affect more than maps. Location-tied system behavior, including time zone and date/time handling, may behave unexpectedly. Only use this if you know what you're doing." = "Beta CoreLocation 模拟。需要已安装并设置 Apple Maps；Maps 是驱动模拟的 RemoteCall 宿主进程。\\n\\n这是手动工具，不是可安装包。使用 Simulate Current Target 开始；使用 Restore Real Location 停止模拟并让 CoreLocation 回到真实定位提供者。每次运行都会打开活动日志，并在请求返回后标记完成。\\n\\n并非所有 App 都会接受模拟位置。使用自身定位校验或额外信号的 App 可能会忽略它。\\n\\n鸣谢：kolbicz 的 RemoteCall/CLSimulationManager GPS spoofer 原型，以及 ezzuldinSt 的 LSpoof 选择器/路线参考。\\n\\n警告：此功能影响的不只是地图。与位置相关的系统行为，包括时区和日期/时间处理，可能出现异常。仅在你知道自己在做什么时使用。";
"Beta: patches SpringBoard runtime methods in memory. Respring restores stock, but unsupported builds may glitch the app switcher or crash SpringBoard. Re-run after any respring." = "Beta：在内存中修补 SpringBoard 运行时方法。respring 会恢复原生状态，但不支持的系统可能导致 App 切换器异常或 SpringBoard 崩溃。每次 respring 后需要重新运行。";
"Beta: persistent CallServices system-file replacement. Disclosure sounds may be legally required where you live; you are responsible for your use and apply this at your own risk. Use Restore Original Sounds before removing Cyanide if you want Cyanide's backups written back." = "Beta：持久化替换 CallServices 系统文件。你所在地可能依法要求保留提示音；使用风险由你自行承担。若希望 Cyanide 写回备份，请在移除 Cyanide 前使用 Restore Original Sounds。";
"Beta: RemoteCall-only physics can be reset by SpringBoard relayouts such as page swipes, rotations, folder transitions, or resprings. Use Restore Icon Layout if icons stay displaced." = "Beta：纯 RemoteCall 物理效果可能被 SpringBoard 重新布局重置，例如翻页、旋转、文件夹切换或 respring。如果图标停留在错误位置，请使用 Restore Icon Layout。";
"Beta: requires Apple Maps installed and set up. Changes CoreLocation's active simulation state — may affect time zone, date/time, and other location-tied behavior. Some apps and services prohibit or detect simulated locations. Only use this if you know what you're doing." = "Beta：需要已安装并设置 Apple Maps。会改变 CoreLocation 的活动模拟状态，可能影响时区、日期/时间和其他依赖位置的行为。某些 App 和服务会禁止或检测模拟位置。仅在你知道自己在做什么时使用。";
"Beta: system asset page zeroing. Run by itself, then respring after hiding. To restore the home indicator, choose Restore Home Bar and respring." = "Beta：系统资源页清零。请单独运行，隐藏后立即 respring。要恢复 Home 指示条，请选择 Restore Home Bar 并 respring。";
