"Define an optional global cleanup() function for scripts that change in-memory state:\n\nglobalThis.cleanup = function () {\n  r_msg2_main(view, \"setHidden:\", 0);\n  clearInterval(timer);\n};\n\nCyanide calls cleanup() before it stops a running script during Clean Up, package disable/removal, or session shutdown. Restore only state captured by the script before it changed it. Keep cleanup() synchronous and fast. Persistent file or system changes cannot be restored automatically." = "对于会修改内存状态的脚本，可定义可选的全局 cleanup() 函数：\n\nglobalThis.cleanup = function () {\n  r_msg2_main(view, \"setHidden:\", 0);\n  clearInterval(timer);\n};\n\nCyanide 会在清理、禁用/移除软件包或会话结束前调用 cleanup()。只恢复脚本修改前自行保存的状态。cleanup() 必须同步且快速完成。持久化的文件或系统修改无法自动还原。";
"Write .js scripts that run inside SpringBoard through Cyanide's RemoteCall bridge. Publish them as a source repo or load them locally with QuickLoader." = "编写通过 Cyanide RemoteCall 桥接在 SpringBoard 内运行的 .js 脚本。可将其发布为源仓库，或通过 QuickLoader 本地加载。";
"A tweak is a plain .js file that runs inside JavaScriptCore. 64-bit pointers are passed as hex strings (e.g. \"0x105f2a000\"). Wrap your code in an IIFE:\n\n(() => {\n  log(\"Hello from my tweak!\");\n  var app = r_msg2(\n    r_class(\"UIApplication\"),\n    \"sharedApplication\");\n  var win = r_msg2(app, \"keyWindow\");\n  // …\n})();\n\nUse log() to print to Cyanide's Log tab. Use r_msg2_main() instead of r_msg2() for anything that touches UIKit views." = "Tweak 就是在 JavaScriptCore 中运行的普通 .js 文件。64 位指针以十六进制字符串传递（例如 \"0x105f2a000\"）。请使用 IIFE 包装代码：\n\n(() => {\n  log(\"Hello from my tweak!\");\n  var app = r_msg2(\n    r_class(\"UIApplication\"),\n    \"sharedApplication\");\n  var win = r_msg2(app, \"keyWindow\");\n  // …\n})();\n\n使用 log() 输出到 Cyanide 的日志 Tab。所有涉及 UIKit view 的操作都应使用 r_msg2_main()，不要使用 r_msg2()。";
"Add @param comments at the top of your script. Cyanide parses them and generates native UI controls in Settings.\n\nSyntax:\n// @param: type | varName | Label | default | range\n\nTypes:\n\nswitch — Boolean toggle\n// @param: switch | enabled | Enable Tweak | true\n\ntext — String text field\n// @param: text | label | Custom Text | Hello\n\ncolor — Hex color picker (#RRGGBB or #RRGGBBAA)\n// @param: color | tint | Tint Color | #00FFCC80\n\nslider — Numeric slider with range\n// @param: slider | radius | Blur | 5.0 | 0.0-10.0\n\nDefault values auto-populate on first install. The slider shows a \"(Def)\" indicator when at the declared default." = "在脚本顶部添加 @param 注释。Cyanide 会解析这些注释，并在设置中生成原生 UI 控件。\n\n语法：\n// @param: type | varName | Label | default | range\n\n类型：\n\nswitch — 布尔开关\n// @param: switch | enabled | Enable Tweak | true\n\ntext — 字符串输入框\n// @param: text | label | Custom Text | Hello\n\ncolor — 十六进制颜色选择器（#RRGGBB 或 #RRGGBBAA）\n// @param: color | tint | Tint Color | #00FFCC80\n\nslider — 带范围的数值滑块\n// @param: slider | radius | Blur | 5.0 | 0.0-10.0\n\n首次安装时会自动填入默认值。滑块处于声明的默认值时会显示 \"(Def)\" 标记。";
"These functions are injected into every JS context:\n\nlog(message)\n  Print to Cyanide's log console.\n\nr_class(name) → pointer\n  Get an Objective-C class pointer.\n  r_class(\"UIApplication\")\n\nr_sel(name) → pointer\n  Convert a string to a native SEL.\n\nr_nsstr(string) → pointer\n  Allocate an NSString in SpringBoard.\n  Call r_msg2(ptr, \"release\") when done.\n\nr_msg2(target, selector, a1, a2, a3, a4)\n  Send an ObjC message. Up to 4 args.\n\nr_msg2_main(target, selector, a1, a2, a3, a4)\n  Same but forced onto the main thread.\n  Required for all UIKit/view changes.\n\nr_responds(target, selector) → bool\n  Check if an object responds to a selector." = "这些函数会注入到每个 JS context：\n\nlog(message)\n  输出到 Cyanide 日志控制台。\n\nr_class(name) → pointer\n  获取 Objective-C class 指针。\n  r_class(\"UIApplication\")\n\nr_sel(name) → pointer\n  将字符串转换为原生 SEL。\n\nr_nsstr(string) → pointer\n  在 SpringBoard 中分配 NSString。\n  使用结束后调用 r_msg2(ptr, \"release\")。\n\nr_msg2(target, selector, a1, a2, a3, a4)\n  发送 ObjC 消息，最多 4 个参数。\n\nr_msg2_main(target, selector, a1, a2, a3, a4)\n  同上，但强制在主线程执行。\n  所有 UIKit/view 修改都必须使用它。\n\nr_responds(target, selector) → bool\n  检查对象是否响应 selector。";
"QuickLoader scripts can read their @param values at runtime:\n\nr_pref_num(\"blurRadius\")   → float\nr_pref_bool(\"enableBlur\")  → boolean\nr_pref_str(\"tintColor\")    → string\n\nRepoTweaks scripts receive their parameters as pre-injected global variables instead." = "QuickLoader 脚本可在运行时读取 @param 值：\n\nr_pref_num(\"blurRadius\")   → float\nr_pref_bool(\"enableBlur\")  → boolean\nr_pref_str(\"tintColor\")    → string\n\nRepoTweaks 脚本则会以预注入的全局变量形式接收参数。";
"Standard timer functions are mapped to GCD background queues so they never block the UI:\n\nsetInterval(fn, ms) → id\nclearInterval(id)\nsetTimeout(fn, ms) → id\nclearTimeout(id)\n\nAll active timers are automatically cancelled when the tweak is disabled or Cyanide cleans up." = "标准定时器函数会映射到 GCD 后台队列，因此不会阻塞 UI：\n\nsetInterval(fn, ms) → id\nclearInterval(id)\nsetTimeout(fn, ms) → id\nclearTimeout(id)\n\n停用 tweak 或 Cyanide 清理时，所有活跃定时器都会自动取消。";
"64-bit IPC can't pass CGFloat arrays directly. Allocate colors through CIColor:\n\nvar hex = \"#00FFCC80\".replace('#','');\nvar r = parseInt(hex.substring(0,2),16)/255;\nvar g = parseInt(hex.substring(2,4),16)/255;\nvar b = parseInt(hex.substring(4,6),16)/255;\nvar a = parseInt(hex.substring(6,8),16)/255;\nvar str = r_nsstr(r+\" \"+g+\" \"+b+\" \"+a);\nvar ci = r_msg2(\n  r_class(\"CIColor\"),\n  \"colorWithString:\", str);\nvar ui = r_msg2(\n  r_class(\"UIColor\"),\n  \"colorWithCIColor:\", ci);\nr_msg2_main(view, \"setBackgroundColor:\", ui);\nr_msg2(str, \"release\");" = "64 位 IPC 不能直接传递 CGFloat 数组。请通过 CIColor 分配颜色：\n\nvar hex = \"#00FFCC80\".replace('#','');\nvar r = parseInt(hex.substring(0,2),16)/255;\nvar g = parseInt(hex.substring(2,4),16)/255;\nvar b = parseInt(hex.substring(4,6),16)/255;\nvar a = parseInt(hex.substring(6,8),16)/255;\nvar str = r_nsstr(r+\" \"+g+\" \"+b+\" \"+a);\nvar ci = r_msg2(\n  r_class(\"CIColor\"),\n  \"colorWithString:\", str);\nvar ui = r_msg2(\n  r_class(\"UIColor\"),\n  \"colorWithCIColor:\", ci);\nr_msg2_main(view, \"setBackgroundColor:\", ui);\nr_msg2(str, \"release\");";
"• Always use r_msg2_main for view manipulation — r_msg2 on a background thread can crash SpringBoard.\n• Release r_nsstr allocations to avoid leaking memory in the SpringBoard process.\n• Use r_responds to check selectors before calling them — iOS versions differ.\n• Test locally with QuickLoader before publishing to a repo.\n• Only run and publish scripts you trust. JS tweaks have full RemoteCall access." = "• 操作 view 时始终使用 r_msg2_main，后台线程调用 r_msg2 可能导致 SpringBoard 崩溃。\n• 释放 r_nsstr 分配的对象，避免 SpringBoard 进程发生内存泄漏。\n• 调用前使用 r_responds 检查 selector，不同 iOS 版本可能不同。\n• 发布到仓库前先用 QuickLoader 本地测试。\n• 只运行和发布可信脚本，JS tweak 拥有完整的 RemoteCall 访问权限。";
