"Main-binary IPA decryptor (beta) for apps already installed on this device. Use Run Kernel Chain to arm KRW without installing any Installer tweak, choose an app, then Start Decrypt (Main Binary).\n\nDecrypt path: arm KRW → find the live process → UUID-matched dump of the main Mach-O → pack Payload/*.ipa into Documents/DecryptedIPAs → share sheet.\n\nNo App Store login or remote download. Encrypted frameworks/appex/dylibs stay encrypted until image-matched dep dump lands." = "面向本机已安装应用的主二进制 IPA 解密器（测试版）。运行内核链即可启用 KRW，无需安装任何 Installer tweak；随后选择应用并点击“开始解密（主二进制）”。\n\n解密路径：启用 KRW → 查找运行中的进程 → 按 UUID 匹配转储主 Mach-O → 将 Payload/*.ipa 打包到 Documents/DecryptedIPAs → 打开分享面板。\n\n不包含 App Store 登录或远程下载。加密的 framework、appex 和 dylib 会保持加密，直到支持按 image 匹配的依赖转储。";
