"Main-binary IPA decryptor (beta). Use Run Kernel Chain on this page to arm KRW without installing any Installer tweak. Then choose an app and Start Decrypt (Main Binary).\n\nDecrypt path: arm KRW → find the live process → UUID-matched dump of the main Mach-O → pack Payload/*.ipa into Documents/DecryptedIPAs.\n\nEncrypted frameworks/appex/dylibs stay encrypted until image-matched dep dump lands. Optional App Store download is still encrypted until dump. SINF re-sign is out of scope." = "主二进制 IPA 解密器（测试版）。在此页面运行内核链即可启用 KRW，无需安装任何 Installer tweak。随后选择应用并点击“开始解密（主二进制）”。\n\n解密路径：启用 KRW → 查找运行中的进程 → 按 UUID 匹配转储主 Mach-O → 将 Payload/*.ipa 打包到 Documents/DecryptedIPAs。\n\n加密的 framework、appex 和 dylib 会保持加密，直到支持按 image 匹配的依赖转储。可选 App Store 下载在转储前仍为加密内容。SINF 重新签名不在范围内。";
