"Start Decrypt (Main Binary)" = "开始解密（主二进制）";
"Requires KRW. Decrypts only the main executable via process-path-matched dump, then packs a Payload IPA. Encrypted frameworks/extensions are left encrypted until image-matched dep dump lands." = "需要 KRW。仅通过进程路径匹配的内存转储解密主可执行文件，然后打包为 Payload IPA。加密的 framework 和扩展会保持加密，直到支持按 image 匹配的依赖转储。";
"Main-binary IPA decryptor (beta). Select an installed user app, run the kernel chain, then Start Decrypt (Main Binary). Cyanide launches the target if needed, matches the live process by executable path (not basename), dumps FairPlay-decrypted pages for the main Mach-O only, clears cryptid, and writes Payload/*.ipa to Documents/DecryptedIPAs.\n\nEncrypted frameworks, appex, and dylibs are inventoried and left encrypted — dependency dump is disabled until image-path matching exists. Optional App Store download still yields an encrypted IPA until a main-binary dump runs. SINF/iTunesMetadata re-sign is out of scope." = "主二进制 IPA 解密器（测试版）。选择已安装应用，运行内核链后点击“开始解密（主二进制）”。Cyanide 会在需要时启动目标应用，通过可执行文件路径匹配运行中的进程，仅转储主 Mach-O 已解密的 FairPlay 页面，清除 cryptid，并将 Payload/*.ipa 写入 Documents/DecryptedIPAs。\n\n加密的 framework、appex 和 dylib 只会列出并保持加密；在实现 image 路径匹配前，依赖转储保持禁用。可选的 App Store 下载在执行主二进制转储前仍是加密 IPA。SINF/iTunesMetadata 重新签名不在范围内。";
"Main-binary FairPlay dump → Payload IPA" = "主二进制 FairPlay 转储 → Payload IPA";
"Main-binary IPA decryptor for installed user apps. Select a target (or paste an App Store link, sign in, and fetch an encrypted IPA), probe FairPlay LC_ENCRYPTION_INFO, then Start Decrypt (Main Binary).\n\nDecrypt path: run the Cyanide kernel chain → launch/find the process whose executable path matches the selected app (not basename-only) → dump decrypted __TEXT crypt pages for the main Mach-O via DarkSword KRW → clear cryptid → pack Payload/*.app into Documents/DecryptedIPAs/*.ipa.\n\nScope: main executable only. Encrypted frameworks, app extensions, and dylibs are listed in the result and left encrypted until image-matched dependency dump is implemented. Optional App Store download still yields an encrypted IPA until dump runs. SINF/iTunesMetadata re-sign is not included.\n\nCredits: main dump flow adapted from lara decrypt.m (neonmodder123)." = "面向已安装用户应用的主二进制 IPA 解密器。选择目标应用（或粘贴 App Store 链接、登录并下载加密 IPA），探测 FairPlay LC_ENCRYPTION_INFO 后，点击“开始解密（主二进制）”。\n\n解密路径：运行 Cyanide 内核链 → 启动/查找可执行文件路径与所选应用匹配的进程（不是仅按名称）→ 通过 DarkSword KRW 转储主 Mach-O 已解密的 __TEXT 加密页面 → 清除 cryptid → 将 Payload/*.app 打包为 Documents/DecryptedIPAs/*.ipa。\n\n范围：仅主可执行文件。加密的 framework、应用扩展和 dylib 会在结果中列出并保持加密，直到实现按 image 匹配的依赖转储。可选的 App Store 下载在转储前仍为加密 IPA。不包含 SINF/iTunesMetadata 重新签名。\n\n致谢：主转储流程改编自 lara 的 decrypt.m（neonmodder123）。";
"⚠️ Beta main-binary only — requires live KRW and a path-matched running target. Encrypted frameworks/extensions are NOT dumped. App Store download + SINF patching remain experimental." = "⚠️ 测试版，仅主二进制：需要可用的 KRW 和路径匹配的运行中目标。不会转储加密的 framework/扩展。App Store 下载和 SINF 修补仍属实验性功能。";
