"Powercuff now defaults to Nominal.\n\nLight, Moderate, and Heavy intentionally underclock the CPU. That means lag or slower app launches can happen, especially on older devices. The lag means Powercuff is working, but those levels may be too slow for comfortable day-to-day use.\n\nUse Nominal for daily use, then raise it only when you want stronger throttling." = "Powercuff 现在默认使用 Nominal。\n\nLight、Moderate 和 Heavy 会有意降低 CPU 频率。这意味着设备可能卡顿或 App 启动变慢，尤其是在旧设备上。出现卡顿说明 Powercuff 正在生效，但这些等级可能慢到不适合日常使用。\n\n日常使用建议选择 Nominal，只在需要更强降频时再调高等级。";
