"Zeros the first page of /System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/MaterialKit.framework/Assets.car using Cyanide's stable file-page zero path, which hides the bottom home indicator after SpringBoard reloads assets.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nRun Hide Home Bar by itself, then respring so SpringBoard refreshes the asset cache. To bring the home indicator back, choose Restore Home Bar and respring again. Other live SpringBoard tweaks, such as App Switcher Grid, should be applied in a separate run after the respring.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nCredits: C4ndyF1sh/ZeroCalories for the Home Bar target and jailbreakdotparty/dirtyZero for the original page-zeroing idea. Cyanide port by zeroxjf." = "使用 Cyanide 稳定的文件页清零路径，将 /System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/MaterialKit.framework/Assets.car 的第一页清零，从而在 SpringBoard 重新加载资源后隐藏底部 Home 指示条。\\n\\n请单独运行 Hide Home Bar，然后立即 respring，避免错误备份或队列混用。要恢复 Home 指示条，请选择 Restore Home Bar 并再次 respring。";
"Zeros the first page of /System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/MaterialKit.framework/Assets.car using Cyanide's stable file-page zero path, which hides the bottom home indicator after SpringBoard reloads assets.\\\\n\\\\nRun Hide Home Bar by itself, then respring so SpringBoard refreshes the asset cache. To bring the home indicator back, choose Restore Home Bar and respring again. Other live SpringBoard tweaks, such as App Switcher Grid, should be applied in a separate run after the respring.\\\\n\\\\nCredits: C4ndyF1sh/ZeroCalories for the Home Bar target and jailbreakdotparty/dirtyZero for the original page-zeroing idea. Cyanide port by zeroxjf." = "使用 Cyanide 稳定的文件页清零路径，将 /System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/MaterialKit.framework/Assets.car 的第一页清零，从而在 SpringBoard 重新加载资源后隐藏底部 Home 指示条。\\n\\n请单独运行 Hide Home Bar，然后立即 respring，避免错误备份或队列混用。要恢复 Home 指示条，请选择 Restore Home Bar 并再次 respring。";
"⚠️ Experimental: work-in-progress. Expect SpringBoard crashes, dropped notifications, layout glitches, and breakage between Cyanide builds. Don't rely on it for anything important." = "⚠️ 实验性：开发中。可能出现 SpringBoard 崩溃、通知丢失、布局异常，以及不同 Cyanide 版本间失效。不要依赖它处理重要事项。";
"⚠️ In development only — install is disabled because this does not work yet. Encrypted IPA download is experimental. SINF/iTunesMetadata patching, task-port dump, and IPA writer stages are not finished yet." = "⚠️ 仅开发中 — 安装已禁用，因为此功能尚不能工作。加密 IPA 下载仍是实验性功能。SINF/iTunesMetadata 修补、task-port dump 和 IPA 写入阶段尚未完成。";
"⚠️ In development only — install is disabled because this does not work yet. Keeps an original-thread imagent RemoteCall session for live polling and may miss indicators or destabilize SpringBoard." = "⚠️ 仅开发中 — 安装已禁用，因为此功能尚不能工作。它会保持一个原线程 imagent RemoteCall 会话用于实时轮询，可能漏掉指示器或让 SpringBoard 不稳定。";
"⚠️ In development only — install is disabled because this does not work yet. Polls SpringBoard notification state over RemoteCall and may miss banners, duplicate activity updates, or destabilize SpringBoard." = "⚠️ 仅开发中 — 安装已禁用，因为此功能尚不能工作。它会通过 RemoteCall 轮询 SpringBoard 通知状态，可能漏掉横幅、重复活动更新，或让 SpringBoard 不稳定。";
"⚠️ In development only — install is disabled because this does not work yet. The live status-bar refresh interferes with other SpringBoard tweaks and can drop readouts entirely." = "⚠️ 仅开发中 — 安装已禁用，因为此功能尚不能工作。实时状态栏刷新会干扰其他 SpringBoard tweak，并可能让读数完全消失。";
