"Cyanide is a limited tweak environment. Session tweaks reset on reboot, while a few packages intentionally modify local system files and may persist until restored. Backups are best-effort only. Use these tools only where you have permission, understand the legal and service-rule impact, and accept the risk. Live tweaks like StatBar and Axon Lite stop if you force-quit Cyanide. A progress log opens while changes apply; tap Hide to dismiss." = "Cyanide 是一个能力受限的 tweak 环境。会话型 tweak 会在重启后重置；少数软件包会有意修改本地系统文件，并可能持续到恢复为止。备份只是尽力而为。请只在你有权限、理解法律和服务规则影响并接受风险的情况下使用这些工具。像 StatBar 和 Axon Lite 这样的实时 tweak 会在强制退出 Cyanide 后停止。应用更改时会打开进度日志；点击隐藏即可关闭。";
