"Enables Apple's internal UIKit debugging overlay in SpringBoard. After applying, double-tap the status bar to open it. Its settings page controls whether Clean Up or exiting Cyanide restores the original behavior; respring always restores stock." = "在 SpringBoard 中启用 Apple 内部 UIKit 调试浮层。应用后，双击状态栏即可打开。可在该功能的设置页中决定执行 Clean Up 或退出 Cyanide 时是否恢复原始行为；respring 始终会恢复原状。";
