"Experimental PoC that inserts a CAMetalLayer into SpringBoard's Lock Screen window and renders one Sticker-inspired light frame.\n\nThis validates whether Metal rendering is usable for a future gravity-reactive Lock Screen light effect. No motion tracking is wired yet." = "实验性 PoC：向 SpringBoard 锁屏窗口插入 CAMetalLayer，并渲染一帧受 Sticker 启发的光效。\n\n用于验证 Metal 渲染是否适合之后实现随重力变化的锁屏光效。目前尚未接入动态追踪。";
"Experimental PoC that inserts a CAMetalLayer into SpringBoard's Lock Screen window and renders a bundled test image with Sticker-inspired Metal effects.\n\nThis validates source-texture rendering and gravity-driven light movement before wiring the effect to the real Lock Screen wallpaper." = "实验性 PoC：向 SpringBoard 锁屏窗口插入 CAMetalLayer，并使用受 Sticker 启发的 Metal 效果渲染内置测试图。\n\n用于在接入真实锁屏壁纸前，验证 source texture 渲染和重力驱动的光源移动。";
