"%ld image(s) were added to Mood Wallpaper." = "已添加 %ld 张图片到趣味壁纸。";
"The selected image could not be imported." = "所选图片无法导入。";
"Both Mood Wallpaper images are ready. Toggle Mood Wallpaper on and tap Run to apply." = "趣味壁纸的两张图片已准备好。启用趣味壁纸后点击运行即可应用。";
"Choose the other Mood Wallpaper image before applying." = "请先选择趣味壁纸的另一张图片。";
"Mood Wallpaper did not start cleanly." = "趣味壁纸未能正常启动。";
"Mood Wallpaper switches between two selected images based on left/right device tilt. It owns the same SpringBoard wallpaper layer space as LiveWP and Metal Lock Light, so only one wallpaper effect can be active at a time." = "趣味壁纸会根据设备左右倾斜方向，在两张选定图片之间切换。它与 LiveWP、Metal Lock Light 使用同一套 SpringBoard 壁纸图层空间，因此同一时间只能启用一个壁纸效果。";
"Mood Wallpaper switches between 2 to 8 selected images based on left/right device tilt. It owns the same SpringBoard wallpaper layer space as LiveWP and Metal Lock Light, so only one wallpaper effect can be active at a time." = "趣味壁纸会根据设备左右倾斜方向，在 2 到 8 张选定图片之间切换。它与 LiveWP、Metal Lock Light 使用同一套 SpringBoard 壁纸图层空间，因此同一时间只能启用一个壁纸效果。";
"Selected Images" = "已选图片";
"%lu selected. Add 2 to 8 images; left tilt uses the first image, right tilt uses the last image." = "已选择 %lu 张。可添加 2 到 8 张图片；左倾使用第一张，右倾使用最后一张。";
"%lu selected. Set one image as the main wallpaper. Level uses the main image; left/right tilt uses images on each side." = "已选择 %lu 张。请设置一张主壁纸；水平时使用主壁纸，左右倾斜时使用主壁纸两侧的图片。";
