"Mood Wallpaper supports up to 8 images." = "趣味壁纸最多支持 8 张图片。";
"%@ was added to Mood Wallpaper. Toggle Mood Wallpaper on and tap Run to apply." = "%@ 已添加到趣味壁纸。启用趣味壁纸后点击运行即可应用。";
