"Mood Wallpaper needs at least 2 images before it can be activated. Open its settings and add 2 to 8 images first." = "趣味壁纸至少需要 2 张图片才能启用。请打开设置并先添加 2 到 8 张图片。";
"Mode (0 Spot / 1 Linear / 2 Ink / 3 Ink Spot)" = "模式 (0 光斑 / 1 线性 / 2 油墨 / 3 油墨光斑)";
"Retry Wallpaper Source" = "重试壁纸来源";
"Wallpaper source retry failed." = "壁纸来源重试失败。";
"Dump Wallpaper Layers" = "导出壁纸图层信息";
"Wallpaper layer dump failed." = "壁纸图层信息导出失败。";
"SpringBoard RemoteCall is not ready." = "SpringBoard RemoteCall 尚未就绪。";
"Metal Lock Light did not start cleanly." = "Metal 锁屏光效未正常启动。";
"Log Only Mode" = "仅记录模式";
"Only log gravity target changes. The main wallpaper stays visible and SpringBoard images are not switched." = "只记录重力目标变化。主壁纸会保持显示，不切换 SpringBoard 图片。";
"Tools" = "工具";
"JavaScript" = "JavaScript";
"Twitter (Original Author)" = "Twitter（原作者）";
"iPad Dock" = "iPad Dock";
"Dock: iPad" = "Dock：iPad 样式";
"Dock: Stock" = "Dock：系统默认";
"Install from the Installer tab and tap Run. Clean Up attempts to restore the stock Dock; a respring always restores it." = "请在安装器页面安装后点击运行。清理会尝试恢复系统默认 Dock；respring 一定会恢复。";
"Scene controller" = "场景控制器";
"Creates and reuses SpringBoard's internal iPad Dock controller in the active scene, including the App Library button. Clean Up restores the stock Dock for the current session; a respring also restores it." = "在当前场景中创建并复用 SpringBoard 内部的 iPad Dock 控制器，包括 App 资源库按钮。清理会在当前会话中恢复系统默认 Dock；respring 也会恢复。";
"Enables the iPad-style Dock with App Library" = "启用带 App 资源库的 iPad 风格 Dock";
"Creates and reuses SpringBoard's internal iPad Dock controller in the active scene, including the App Library button.\n\nThe patch writes no system files. Clean Up restores the stock Dock for the current session; a respring also restores the stock Dock." = "在当前场景中创建并复用 SpringBoard 内部的 iPad Dock 控制器，包括 App 资源库按钮。\n\n该补丁不会写入系统文件。清理会在当前会话中恢复系统默认 Dock；respring 也会恢复系统默认 Dock。";
"Uses private SpringBoard scene controllers and changes Dock capability gates in memory. Unsupported builds may glitch the Dock, respring SpringBoard, or crash it." = "使用 SpringBoard 私有场景控制器，并在内存中修改 Dock 功能开关。不受支持的系统版本可能导致 Dock 显示异常、SpringBoard respring 或崩溃。";
"Saved repo script" = "已保存的 repo 脚本";
"%@ is not shown in the standalone editor. Clear it here to prevent future automatic runs." = "%@ 不会显示在独立编辑器中。在此清除它可阻止之后自动运行。";
"Docs" = "文档";
"How tweaks work" = "Tweak 的工作方式";
"Read sbcustomizer.m, statbar.m, rssidisplay.m, and axonlite.m in Cyanide/tweaks/ for shipped patterns at increasing complexity." = "可阅读 Cyanide/tweaks/ 中的 sbcustomizer.m、statbar.m、rssidisplay.m 和 axonlite.m，了解由浅入深的已发布实现模式。";
"Cyanide tweaks are app-side drivers. No SpringBoard dylibs, no Substrate hooks, no swizzled methods. The app reaches into the target from outside." = "Cyanide tweak 是 App 侧的驱动器：没有 SpringBoard dylib、没有 Substrate hook，也没有方法 swizzle。App 从外部操作目标进程。";
"A RemoteCall session is the bridge. From inside one you send Objective-C messages, read and write memory, and call C symbols in the target process." = "RemoteCall session 是桥梁。通过它可以向目标进程发送 Objective-C 消息、读写内存，以及调用 C symbol。";
"Settings holds the SpringBoard channel during Apply Tweaks. Your code runs inside it under settings_rc_lock(), via three entrypoints: apply_in_session, optional stop_in_session, and forget_remote_state." = "执行 Apply Tweaks 时，Settings 会持有 SpringBoard 通道。你的代码在 settings_rc_lock() 保护下通过三个入口运行：apply_in_session、可选的 stop_in_session 和 forget_remote_state。";
"The remote_objc API" = "remote_objc API";
"_main variants dispatch to the target main thread (use them for UIKit). _raw passes non-pointer arguments by value. r_msg2_main_struct_ret copies struct returns such as CGRect." = "_main 变体会调度到目标主线程（UIKit 应使用它们）。_raw 按值传递非指针参数。r_msg2_main_struct_ret 可复制 CGRect 等结构体返回值。";
"Import remote_objc.h and ../TaskRop/RemoteCall.h. Helpers assume an active session — don't call init_remote_call yourself unless you need a private channel." = "导入 remote_objc.h 和 ../TaskRop/RemoteCall.h。辅助函数假设已有活跃 session，除非需要私有通道，否则不要自行调用 init_remote_call。";
"A minimal tweak" = "最小 Tweak 示例";
"Drop both files in Cyanide/tweaks/. The Xcode project uses PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup, so new files are picked up automatically — no pbxproj edits needed." = "将两个文件放入 Cyanide/tweaks/。Xcode 项目使用 PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup，会自动识别新文件，无需修改 pbxproj。";
"A complete RemoteCall-only tweak: paints an 80×80 red square on a SpringBoard window." = "一个完整的仅 RemoteCall tweak：在 SpringBoard 窗口上绘制 80×80 的红色方块。";
"Idempotent on reapply, undoes itself on stop, drops cached pointers on respawn." = "重复应用时保持幂等，停止时自行撤销，respawn 时丢弃缓存指针。";
"Wiring into Settings" = "接入 Settings";
"Mirror an existing kSettings…Enabled path — search kSettingsStatBarEnabled or kSettingsAxonLiteEnabled for a complete template covering defaults, rows, package state, Run, live apply, stop, and cleanup." = "参考已有的 kSettings…Enabled 路径。搜索 kSettingsStatBarEnabled 或 kSettingsAxonLiteEnabled，可看到涵盖默认值、设置行、软件包状态、Run、实时应用、停止和清理的完整模板。";
"SettingsViewController.m is the orchestrator. Add five things: a defaults key, a switch row, a Run-path apply, a live-apply branch, and forget_remote_state in cleanup." = "SettingsViewController.m 是协调器。需添加五项：默认设置 key、开关行、Run 路径的 apply、实时应用分支，以及清理中的 forget_remote_state。";
"Every apply checks g_springboard_rc_ready inside @synchronized(settings_rc_lock()). settings_mark_tweak_applied() keeps package state honest. forget_remote_state() runs on respring and abandon." = "每次 apply 都会在 @synchronized(settings_rc_lock()) 内检查 g_springboard_rc_ready。settings_mark_tweak_applied() 保持软件包状态正确；forget_remote_state() 会在 respring 和 abandon 时运行。";
"Porting from Theos / Substrate" = "从 Theos / Substrate 移植";
"Shipped templates: sbcustomizer (dock layout), darksword_tweaks (SpringBoard state toggles), powercuff (thermalmonitord one-shot), statbar (overlay window), rssidisplay (per-icon overlays), axonlite (cached NC state)." = "已发布模板：sbcustomizer（Dock 布局）、darksword_tweaks（SpringBoard 状态开关）、powercuff（thermalmonitord 单次操作）、statbar（覆盖窗口）、rssidisplay（逐图标覆盖层）、axonlite（缓存的通知中心状态）。";
"RemoteCall isn't a hook framework. You can't intercept a method or replace a C function in place." = "RemoteCall 不是 hook 框架，不能拦截方法或原地替换 C 函数。";
"Ports work when the effect is a finite mutation — set this property, call this controller method, add this view, hold this assertion, or refresh on a timer." = "当效果可表示为有限次修改时，移植才适用：设置属性、调用控制器方法、添加 view、保持 assertion 或通过定时器刷新。";
"Targeting another process? Open a separate session with init_remote_call(name, false), do the work, destroy_remote_call before switching back. Powercuff does this for thermalmonitord." = "需要操作其他进程？使用 init_remote_call(name, false) 建立单独 session，完成工作后在切回前 destroy_remote_call。Powercuff 对 thermalmonitord 就是这样做的。";
"Contribute" = "贡献";
"Build with ./scripts/build.sh — the IPA is packaged under build/. Sideload, test on device, attach Log-tab output to your PR." = "使用 ./scripts/build.sh 构建，IPA 会输出到 build/。侧载后在真机测试，并将 Log Tab 输出附到你的 PR。";
"Source and issues: https://github.com/zeroxjf/cyanide" = "源码与 Issue：https://github.com/zeroxjf/cyanide";
